{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Human:</strong> a psychological horror journey where the desperate need to connect with someone can become your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> You\u2019ve spent most of your life alone. Your days are monotonous, empty, with no one by your side. At your lowest point, you make a desperate decision: to find someone to share your life with, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds entirely within your own home\u2026 a peculiar place filled with strange hallways, mismatched rooms, and a long, false chamber that hides more than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/463547e396c64134622d76efb096cacf.poster.avif?t=1756915756\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/463547e396c64134622d76efb096cacf.webm?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/463547e396c64134622d76efb096cacf.mp4?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Good Human is a linear 3D experience with a strange and abstract style. Explore your home as every corner seems to whisper truths you\u2019re not ready to hear. An oppressive, silent, and lonely atmosphere will follow you with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/4ea916cbf93f397e4976b14053c10a78.poster.avif?t=1756915756\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/4ea916cbf93f397e4976b14053c10a78.webm?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/4ea916cbf93f397e4976b14053c10a78.mp4?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game explores obsession, isolation, and the desperate need to connect\u2026 sometimes with unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/1946c194241e927243c23761501e8430.poster.avif?t=1756915756\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/1946c194241e927243c23761501e8430.webm?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/1946c194241e927243c23761501e8430.mp4?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duration:</strong> Good Human is designed to deliver an intense, complete experience in a single session. The game lasts approximately 25 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/ce8bf2b64c7de16078ba1c937bf22487.poster.avif?t=1756915756\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/ce8bf2b64c7de16078ba1c937bf22487.webm?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989970/extras/ce8bf2b64c7de16078ba1c937bf22487.mp4?t=1756915756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgr